  "donate.window_title": "Make a donation",
  "donate.text": "Hello.\n\nThank you for using my GUI, and for my part, I am deeply grateful to the community that regularly updates YT-DLP, a wonderful tool without which none of this would be possible.\n\nThe purpose of this GUI is to make YT-DLP accessible to everyone, while unleashing and enhancing its capabilities.\n\nI hope that, if you are on this page reading these lines, this tool has been useful to you and that you are happy with it.\n\nThe GUI is, has always been, and will remain free and open to everyone.\n\nIf you are particularly happy with this tool, you can freely make a donation using the button below.",
